Usage:

-a {line number} {input file} (optional){output file} "string"
appends string to end of line # line number, leaves input unchanged if output provided otherwise edits input

-r {line number} {input file} (optional){output file} "string"
replaces line # line number with string, leaves input unchanged if output provided otherwise edits input

-p (optional){line number} {input file}
prints line # line number of input file, if none provided prints whole file
